            "title": "Netflix stock briefly showed a 90% decline. Don't worry, it's a stock split.",
            "description": "<p>Netflix (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NFLX\">NFLX</a>) shares briefly showed a 90% decline Monday morning. It's because of the streaming giant's <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://ir.netflix.net/investor-news-and-events/financial-releases/press-release-details/2025/Netflix-Announces-Ten-For-One-Stock-Split/default.aspx\">10-for-1 stock split</a>. \"Free-for-all\" artificial intelligence announcement helps Alibaba (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BABA\">BABA</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/9988.HK\">9988.HK</a>) rebound after a tough week, while tensions between China and Japan affect stocks including <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://uk.finance.yahoo.com/quote/4911.T/\">Shiseido</a>. Finally, here's why Clearwater Analytics (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CWAN\">CWAN</a>) is soaring.</p>\n<p>For more live coverage of the markets, watch the full episode of <em>Market Sunrise</em> and visit<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/\"> Yahoo Finance</a>.</p>\n<p><em>Editor's note: The headline and post were updated to reflect Netflix's stock split.</em></p>",
